#. type: Title #
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Designing packages for Yii applications"
msgstr "Projetando pacotes para aplicações Yii"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "This page describes how to design a Composer package that adds behavior to a Yii application through configuration.  Use it when your package needs to register services, routes, events, commands, assets, migrations, translations, or a theme."
msgstr "Esta página descreve como projetar um pacote Composer que acrescenta comportamento a uma aplicação Yii por meio de configuração.  Use-a quando o seu pacote precisar registrar serviços, rotas, eventos, comandos, assets, migrations, traduções ou um tema."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "For installing and updating packages in an application, see [Using packages](package.md)."
msgstr "Para instalar e atualizar pacotes em uma aplicação, veja [Usando pacotes](package.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Composer metadata"
msgstr "Metadados do Composer"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Each package must have a `composer.json` file in its root directory. At minimum, define a package name, dependencies, autoloading, and Yii config metadata when the package integrates with a Yii application."
msgstr "Todo pacote precisa ter um arquivo `composer.json` na pasta raiz. No mínimo, defina o nome do pacote, as dependências, o autoload e os metadados de configuração do Yii quando o pacote se integra a uma aplicação Yii."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use a package name in the `vendor-name/project-name` format:"
msgstr "Use um nome de pacote no formato `vendor-name/project-name`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    \"name\": \"vendor/blog\",\n"
"    \"type\": \"library\",\n"
"    \"description\": \"Blog integration for Yii applications\",\n"
"    \"require\": {\n"
"        \"php\": \">=8.2\",\n"
"        \"yiisoft/router\": \"^4.0\"\n"
"    },\n"
"    \"autoload\": {\n"
"        \"psr-4\": {\n"
"            \"Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\\": \"src/\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    \"name\": \"vendor/blog\",\n"
"    \"type\": \"library\",\n"
"    \"description\": \"Blog integration for Yii applications\",\n"
"    \"require\": {\n"
"        \"php\": \">=8.2\",\n"
"        \"yiisoft/router\": \"^4.0\"\n"
"    },\n"
"    \"autoload\": {\n"
"        \"psr-4\": {\n"
"            \"Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\\": \"src/\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use stable dependency constraints for stable releases. Avoid using `yiisoft` as your vendor name because it is reserved for Yii packages."
msgstr "Use restrições de dependência estáveis em releases estáveis. Evite usar `yiisoft` como nome de vendor, porque ele é reservado para os pacotes do Yii."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "If your package requires a Yii application, prefixing the project name with `yii-` can make that clear on Packagist."
msgstr "Se o seu pacote exige uma aplicação Yii, prefixar o nome do projeto com `yii-` pode deixar isso claro no Packagist."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package layout"
msgstr "Estrutura do pacote"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "A Yii-aware package is a regular Composer package with PHP classes, optional resource files, and optional config files.  Keep the configuration in a predictable directory and make the public API explicit:"
msgstr "Um pacote compatível com o Yii é um pacote Composer comum, com classes PHP, arquivos de recursos opcionais e arquivos de configuração opcionais.  Mantenha a configuração em uma pasta previsível e deixe a API pública explícita:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"composer.json\n"
"config/\n"
"    params.php\n"
"    di.php\n"
"    di-providers.php\n"
"    routes.php\n"
"    events.php\n"
"    params-web.php\n"
"    params-console.php\n"
"    di-console.php\n"
"src/\n"
"    ...\n"
"assets/\n"
"    ...\n"
"migrations/\n"
"    ...\n"
"messages/\n"
"    ...\n"
"views/\n"
"    ...\n"
msgstr ""
"composer.json\n"
"config/\n"
"    params.php\n"
"    di.php\n"
"    di-providers.php\n"
"    routes.php\n"
"    events.php\n"
"    params-web.php\n"
"    params-console.php\n"
"    di-console.php\n"
"src/\n"
"    ...\n"
"assets/\n"
"    ...\n"
"migrations/\n"
"    ...\n"
"messages/\n"
"    ...\n"
"views/\n"
"    ...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use only the files your package needs. For example, a package with console commands but no web routes does not need `routes.php`."
msgstr "Use apenas os arquivos de que o seu pacote precisa. Por exemplo, um pacote com comandos de console, mas sem rotas web, não precisa de `routes.php`."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Config plugin metadata"
msgstr "Metadados do plugin de configuração"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Yii applications use [yiisoft/config](https://github.com/yiisoft/config) to discover package configuration.  Declare package config files in the `extra.config-plugin` section of `composer.json`:"
msgstr "Aplicações Yii usam o [yiisoft/config](https://github.com/yiisoft/config) para descobrir a configuração dos pacotes.  Declare os arquivos de configuração do pacote na seção `extra.config-plugin` do `composer.json`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    \"name\": \"vendor/blog\",\n"
"    \"type\": \"library\",\n"
"    \"autoload\": {\n"
"        \"psr-4\": {\n"
"            \"Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\\": \"src/\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    },\n"
"    \"extra\": {\n"
"        \"config-plugin\": {\n"
"            \"params\": \"config/params.php\",\n"
"            \"di\": \"config/di.php\",\n"
"            \"di-providers\": \"config/di-providers.php\",\n"
"            \"routes\": \"config/routes.php\",\n"
"            \"events\": \"config/events.php\",\n"
"            \"params-web\": \"config/params-web.php\",\n"
"            \"params-console\": \"config/params-console.php\",\n"
"            \"di-console\": \"config/di-console.php\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    \"name\": \"vendor/blog\",\n"
"    \"type\": \"library\",\n"
"    \"autoload\": {\n"
"        \"psr-4\": {\n"
"            \"Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\\": \"src/\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    },\n"
"    \"extra\": {\n"
"        \"config-plugin\": {\n"
"            \"params\": \"config/params.php\",\n"
"            \"di\": \"config/di.php\",\n"
"            \"di-providers\": \"config/di-providers.php\",\n"
"            \"routes\": \"config/routes.php\",\n"
"            \"events\": \"config/events.php\",\n"
"            \"params-web\": \"config/params-web.php\",\n"
"            \"params-console\": \"config/params-console.php\",\n"
"            \"di-console\": \"config/di-console.php\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Each `config-plugin` key is a config group name and each value is a path relative to the package root."
msgstr "Cada chave de `config-plugin` é o nome de um grupo de configuração, e cada valor é um caminho relativo à raiz do pacote."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use the common, web, and console groups consistently:"
msgstr "Use os grupos comuns, web e de console de forma consistente:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "`params`, `di`, `di-providers`, `di-delegates`, `events`, and `bootstrap` apply to both web and console entry points."
msgstr "`params`, `di`, `di-providers`, `di-delegates`, `events` e `bootstrap` valem para os pontos de entrada web e de console."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "`params-web`, `di-web`, `di-providers-web`, `events-web`, `bootstrap-web`, and `routes` apply to web entry points."
msgstr "`params-web`, `di-web`, `di-providers-web`, `events-web`, `bootstrap-web` e `routes` valem para os pontos de entrada web."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "`params-console`, `di-console`, `di-providers-console`, `events-console`, and `bootstrap-console` apply to console entry points."
msgstr "`params-console`, `di-console`, `di-providers-console`, `events-console` e `bootstrap-console` valem para os pontos de entrada de console."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "If your package defines a new config group, document how an application should load that group. Prefer the standard groups when you integrate with Yii services because application templates and Yii packages already use these names."
msgstr "Se o seu pacote define um novo grupo de configuração, documente como a aplicação deve carregar esse grupo. Prefira os grupos padrão ao se integrar com serviços do Yii, porque os templates de aplicação e os pacotes do Yii já usam esses nomes."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "After users install, update, remove, or dump Composer autoload files, the config plugin rebuilds the merge plan that Yii reads at runtime. If users edit their root package configuration manually, ask them to run:"
msgstr "Depois que os usuários instalam, atualizam, removem ou fazem dump dos arquivos de autoload do Composer, o plugin de configuração reconstrói o merge plan que o Yii lê em tempo de execução. Se os usuários editarem manualmente a configuração do pacote raiz, peça que executem:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Put default options in `config/params.php`. Group package parameters under the Composer package name to avoid collisions:"
msgstr "Coloque as opções padrão em `config/params.php`. Agrupe os parâmetros do pacote sob o nome do pacote no Composer para evitar colisões:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'vendor/blog' => [\n"
"        'postsPerPage' => 20,\n"
"        'cacheTtl' => 3600,\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'vendor/blog' => [\n"
"        'postsPerPage' => 20,\n"
"        'cacheTtl' => 3600,\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Application developers can override these values in their own `config/common/params.php`, `config/web/params.php`, `config/console/params.php`, or environment-specific parameter files."
msgstr "Os desenvolvedores da aplicação podem sobrescrever esses valores nos próprios `config/common/params.php`, `config/web/params.php`, `config/console/params.php` ou nos arquivos de parâmetros específicos de cada ambiente."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Do not read environment variables or global state from package code when a parameter can express the choice. Use parameters to configure services through DI definitions or service providers."
msgstr "Não leia variáveis de ambiente nem estado global no código do pacote quando um parâmetro puder expressar a escolha. Use parâmetros para configurar serviços por meio de definições de DI ou service providers."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "DI definitions"
msgstr "Definições de DI"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use `config/di.php`, `config/di-web.php`, or `config/di-console.php` for direct container definitions:"
msgstr "Use `config/di.php`, `config/di-web.php` ou `config/di-console.php` para definições diretas do container:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepositoryInterface;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    PostRepositoryInterface::class => [\n"
"        'class' => PostRepository::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'cacheTtl' => $params['vendor/blog']['cacheTtl'],\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepositoryInterface;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    PostRepositoryInterface::class => [\n"
"        'class' => PostRepository::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'cacheTtl' => $params['vendor/blog']['cacheTtl'],\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Prefer direct DI definitions when the configuration describes one service clearly."
msgstr "Prefira definições de DI diretas quando a configuração descreve um serviço de forma clara."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "DI service providers"
msgstr "Service providers de DI"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use a DI provider when registration belongs together as a reusable unit: several related services, aliases, factory definitions, or extensions."
msgstr "Use um provider de DI quando o registro forma uma unidade reutilizável: vários serviços relacionados, aliases, definições de factory ou extensões."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Register providers in `config/di-providers.php`:"
msgstr "Registre os providers em `config/di-providers.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Provider\\BlogProvider;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'vendor/blog/post-repository' => BlogProvider::class,\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Provider\\BlogProvider;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'vendor/blog/post-repository' => BlogProvider::class,\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Declare the group in `composer.json`:"
msgstr "Declare o grupo no `composer.json`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\"extra\": {\n"
"    \"config-plugin\": {\n"
"        \"di-providers\": \"config/di-providers.php\"\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"\"extra\": {\n"
"    \"config-plugin\": {\n"
"        \"di-providers\": \"config/di-providers.php\"\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "A provider can return several service definitions and extensions. Place the provider class in `src/Provider/BlogProvider.php`:"
msgstr "Um provider pode retornar várias definições de serviços e extensões. Coloque a classe do provider em `src/Provider/BlogProvider.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace Vendor\\Blog\\Provider;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Container\\ContainerInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Log\\LoggerInterface;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\CachedPostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepositoryInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Di\\ServiceProviderInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final class BlogProvider implements ServiceProviderInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function getDefinitions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            PostRepository::class => PostRepository::class,\n"
"            PostRepositoryInterface::class => static fn (\n"
"                ContainerInterface $container\n"
"            ): CachedPostRepository => new CachedPostRepository(\n"
"                $container->get(PostRepository::class),\n"
"                $container->get(LoggerInterface::class),\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getExtensions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace Vendor\\Blog\\Provider;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Container\\ContainerInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Log\\LoggerInterface;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\CachedPostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepositoryInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Di\\ServiceProviderInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final class BlogProvider implements ServiceProviderInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function getDefinitions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            PostRepository::class => PostRepository::class,\n"
"            PostRepositoryInterface::class => static fn (\n"
"                ContainerInterface $container\n"
"            ): CachedPostRepository => new CachedPostRepository(\n"
"                $container->get(PostRepository::class),\n"
"                $container->get(LoggerInterface::class),\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getExtensions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Web packages can add routes through `config/routes.php`, declared as the `routes` group:"
msgstr "Pacotes web podem adicionar rotas por meio de `config/routes.php`, declarado como o grupo `routes`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Web\\Post\\IndexAction;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/blog')->routes(\n"
"        Route::get('')\n"
"            ->action(IndexAction::class)\n"
"            ->name('vendor/blog/index'),\n"
"    ),\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Web\\Post\\IndexAction;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/blog')->routes(\n"
"        Route::get('')\n"
"            ->action(IndexAction::class)\n"
"            ->name('vendor/blog/index'),\n"
"    ),\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Route names should be package-prefixed. This avoids collisions with application routes and with routes from other packages."
msgstr "Os nomes das rotas devem ter o prefixo do pacote. Isso evita colisões com as rotas da aplicação e com as rotas de outros pacotes."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Keep package routes small and overridable. If an application needs full control over URLs, document the actions and let the application define its own routes."
msgstr "Mantenha as rotas do pacote pequenas e fáceis de sobrescrever. Se uma aplicação precisar de controle total sobre as URLs, documente as actions e deixe a aplicação definir as próprias rotas."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use `config/events.php`, `config/events-web.php`, or `config/events-console.php` to attach package handlers to events:"
msgstr "Use `config/events.php`, `config/events-web.php` ou `config/events-console.php` para associar handlers do pacote a eventos:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Event\\PostPublished;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\EventHandler\\ClearPostListCache;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    PostPublished::class => [\n"
"        ClearPostListCache::class,\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Event\\PostPublished;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\EventHandler\\ClearPostListCache;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    PostPublished::class => [\n"
"        ClearPostListCache::class,\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Handlers can be closures, callables, invokable objects, invokable class names, or DI aliases supported by the event dispatcher configuration. Prefer class names for package handlers because applications can override their dependencies through the container."
msgstr "Os handlers podem ser closures, callables, objetos invocáveis, nomes de classes invocáveis ou aliases de DI suportados pela configuração do event dispatcher. Prefira nomes de classes para os handlers do pacote, porque as aplicações podem sobrescrever as dependências deles pelo container."

#. type: Title #
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md ../src/guide/views/asset.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assets"
msgstr "Assets"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "If your package ships CSS, JavaScript, images, or fonts, define asset bundles as PHP classes. For example, place this class in `src/Asset/BlogAsset.php`:"
msgstr "Se o seu pacote traz CSS, JavaScript, imagens ou fontes, defina asset bundles como classes PHP. Por exemplo, coloque esta classe em `src/Asset/BlogAsset.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace Vendor\\Blog\\Asset;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle;\n"
"\n"
"final class BlogAsset extends AssetBundle\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?string $basePath = '@assets';\n"
"    public ?string $baseUrl = '@assetsUrl';\n"
"    public ?string $sourcePath = __DIR__ . '/../../assets';\n"
"\n"
"    public array $css = [\n"
"        'blog.css',\n"
"    ];\n"
"\n"
"    public array $js = [\n"
"        'blog.js',\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace Vendor\\Blog\\Asset;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle;\n"
"\n"
"final class BlogAsset extends AssetBundle\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?string $basePath = '@assets';\n"
"    public ?string $baseUrl = '@assetsUrl';\n"
"    public ?string $sourcePath = __DIR__ . '/../../assets';\n"
"\n"
"    public array $css = [\n"
"        'blog.css',\n"
"    ];\n"
"\n"
"    public array $js = [\n"
"        'blog.js',\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Users can register the bundle from a view, widget, view injection, or action:"
msgstr "Os usuários podem registrar o bundle a partir de uma view, de um widget, de uma injeção de view ou de uma action:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$assetManager->register(BlogAsset::class);\n"
msgstr "$assetManager->register(BlogAsset::class);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use `$sourcePath` for files shipped inside the package. Use `$basePath` and `$baseUrl` as the public target where the asset manager publishes them."
msgstr "Use `$sourcePath` para os arquivos que vêm dentro do pacote. Use `$basePath` e `$baseUrl` como o destino público onde o asset manager os publica."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Packages that need database schema changes should ship migrations and add their namespace or path to `yiisoft/db-migration` parameters."
msgstr "Pacotes que precisam de mudanças no esquema do banco de dados devem trazer migrations e adicionar o namespace ou o caminho delas aos parâmetros do `yiisoft/db-migration`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "For namespaced migrations:"
msgstr "Para migrations com namespace:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-migration' => [\n"
"        'sourceNamespaces' => [\n"
"            'Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\Migration',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-migration' => [\n"
"        'sourceNamespaces' => [\n"
"            'Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\Migration',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "For path-based migrations:"
msgstr "Para migrations baseadas em caminho:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-migration' => [\n"
"        'sourcePaths' => [\n"
"            __DIR__ . '/../migrations',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-migration' => [\n"
"        'sourcePaths' => [\n"
"            __DIR__ . '/../migrations',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Put this in `config/params-console.php` and declare it as `params-console` in `composer.json`."
msgstr "Coloque isso em `config/params-console.php` e declare-o como `params-console` no `composer.json`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "This only contributes package migration locations. The application still needs `yiisoft/db-migration` installed and a database connection configured before migration commands can run."
msgstr "Isso apenas informa os locais das migrations do pacote. A aplicação ainda precisa ter o `yiisoft/db-migration` instalado e uma conexão com o banco de dados configurada antes que os comandos de migration possam rodar."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Package migrations must be stable after release. Do not edit a migration that users may already have applied. Add a new migration instead."
msgstr "As migrations do pacote devem ficar estáveis depois do release. Não edite uma migration que os usuários talvez já tenham aplicado. Em vez disso, adicione uma nova migration."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "Traduções"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "If the package has user-facing messages, give it a dedicated translation category and register a category source in `config/di.php`:"
msgstr "Se o pacote tem mensagens exibidas ao usuário, dê a ele uma categoria de tradução própria e registre uma category source em `config/di.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\CategorySource;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\IntlMessageFormatter;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\Message\\Php\\MessageSource;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'translation.vendor-blog' => [\n"
"        'definition' => static function (): CategorySource {\n"
"            $messageSource = new MessageSource(__DIR__ . '/../messages');\n"
"\n"
"            return new CategorySource(\n"
"                'vendor-blog',\n"
"                $messageSource,\n"
"                new IntlMessageFormatter(),\n"
"                $messageSource,\n"
"            );\n"
"        },\n"
"        'tags' => ['translation.categorySource'],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\CategorySource;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\IntlMessageFormatter;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\Message\\Php\\MessageSource;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'translation.vendor-blog' => [\n"
"        'definition' => static function (): CategorySource {\n"
"            $messageSource = new MessageSource(__DIR__ . '/../messages');\n"
"\n"
"            return new CategorySource(\n"
"                'vendor-blog',\n"
"                $messageSource,\n"
"                new IntlMessageFormatter(),\n"
"                $messageSource,\n"
"            );\n"
"        },\n"
"        'tags' => ['translation.categorySource'],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Store messages by locale and category:"
msgstr "Guarde as mensagens por locale e categoria:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"messages/\n"
"    en-US/\n"
"        vendor-blog.php\n"
"    de/\n"
"        vendor-blog.php\n"
msgstr ""
"messages/\n"
"    en-US/\n"
"        vendor-blog.php\n"
"    de/\n"
"        vendor-blog.php\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use the explicit category when translating:"
msgstr "Use a categoria explícita ao traduzir:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$translator->translate('post.created', category: 'vendor-blog');\n"
msgstr "$translator->translate('post.created', category: 'vendor-blog');\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Themes"
msgstr "Temas"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "A package can ship view files and assets for a theme. Do not activate it from vendor package configuration. Instead, document the root application configuration needed to enable it. For the application template, this belongs in `config/web/params.php`:"
msgstr "Um pacote pode trazer arquivos de view e assets para um tema. Não o ative pela configuração do pacote em vendor. Em vez disso, documente a configuração da aplicação raiz necessária para habilitá-lo. No template de aplicação, isso fica em `config/web/params.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/view' => [\n"
"        'theme' => [\n"
"            'pathMap' => [\n"
"                '@views' => '@vendor/vendor/blog/views',\n"
"            ],\n"
"            'basePath' => '@vendor/vendor/blog/assets',\n"
"            'baseUrl' => '@assetsUrl/vendor-blog',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/view' => [\n"
"        'theme' => [\n"
"            'pathMap' => [\n"
"                '@views' => '@vendor/vendor/blog/views',\n"
"            ],\n"
"            'basePath' => '@vendor/vendor/blog/assets',\n"
"            'baseUrl' => '@assetsUrl/vendor-blog',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Themes replace view paths according to a path map. Document which application view paths your theme replaces and which asset URL must be published or exposed by the application."
msgstr "Os temas substituem caminhos de views de acordo com um mapa de caminhos. Documente quais caminhos de views da aplicação o seu tema substitui e qual URL de assets a aplicação precisa publicar ou expor."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Do not set `yiisoft/view.theme` directly in vendor package configuration. `yiisoft/view` already defines that key, and duplicate keys in the same configuration layer are not allowed."
msgstr "Não defina `yiisoft/view.theme` diretamente na configuração do pacote em vendor. O `yiisoft/view` já define essa chave, e chaves duplicadas na mesma camada de configuração não são permitidas."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "If your package only provides optional theme files, do not make the theme active by default. Provide the view files, asset bundle, and a documented parameter snippet so the application can opt in."
msgstr "Se o seu pacote fornece apenas arquivos de tema opcionais, não deixe o tema ativo por padrão. Forneça os arquivos de view, o asset bundle e um trecho de parâmetros documentado, para que a aplicação possa optar por usá-lo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Console packages can add Symfony Console commands through `config/params-console.php`:"
msgstr "Pacotes de console podem adicionar comandos do Symfony Console por meio de `config/params-console.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Command\\ReindexCommand;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/yii-console' => [\n"
"        'commands' => [\n"
"            'blog/reindex' => ReindexCommand::class,\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Command\\ReindexCommand;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/yii-console' => [\n"
"        'commands' => [\n"
"            'blog/reindex' => ReindexCommand::class,\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Command names should be package-prefixed. Keep command dependencies constructor-injected and registered through DI."
msgstr "Os nomes dos comandos devem ter o prefixo do pacote. Mantenha as dependências dos comandos injetadas pelo construtor e registradas via DI."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Application overrides"
msgstr "Sobrescritas pela aplicação"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Package configuration is the default layer. The application can override it in its root package configuration.  Design for that:"
msgstr "A configuração do pacote é a camada padrão. A aplicação pode sobrescrevê-la na configuração do pacote raiz.  Projete pensando nisso:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use package-prefixed parameter keys, route names, event handler IDs, and DI aliases."
msgstr "Use chaves de parâmetros, nomes de rotas, IDs de handlers de eventos e aliases de DI com o prefixo do pacote."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Keep default configuration small and documented."
msgstr "Mantenha a configuração padrão pequena e documentada."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Avoid doing irreversible work during service registration."
msgstr "Evite fazer trabalho irreversível durante o registro de serviços."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Put optional integrations in separate config files or providers when they require optional Composer packages."
msgstr "Coloque integrações opcionais em arquivos de configuração ou providers separados quando elas exigirem pacotes Composer opcionais."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Test the package inside a minimal Yii application so the config plugin, DI container, routes, console commands, migrations, translations, and assets are exercised together."
msgstr "Teste o pacote dentro de uma aplicação Yii mínima, para que o plugin de configuração, o container de DI, as rotas, os comandos de console, as migrations, as traduções e os assets sejam exercitados juntos."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "When a user needs to customize package configuration, they usually do not need to copy the package config file. They can partially redefine the needed keys in the application configuration."
msgstr "Quando um usuário precisa personalizar a configuração do pacote, normalmente não precisa copiar o arquivo de configuração do pacote. Ele pode redefinir parcialmente as chaves necessárias na configuração da aplicação."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "After changing config group mappings, they should rebuild the merge plan with:"
msgstr "Depois de alterar os mapeamentos de grupos de configuração, ele deve reconstruir o merge plan com:"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Releasing packages"
msgstr "Publicando pacotes"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Before tagging a release, test the package by itself and inside a minimal Yii application. Include a `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and `UPGRADE.md` when behavior or configuration changes require explanation."
msgstr "Antes de criar a tag de um release, teste o pacote isoladamente e dentro de uma aplicação Yii mínima. Inclua `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md` e `UPGRADE.md` quando mudanças de comportamento ou de configuração precisarem de explicação."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use [semantic versioning](https://semver.org) for public releases. After the first release, do not edit migrations that users may already have applied; add new migrations instead."
msgstr "Use [versionamento semântico](https://semver.org) nos releases públicos. Depois do primeiro release, não edite migrations que os usuários talvez já tenham aplicado; adicione novas migrations."
